uChiKhenThuong\nQuyetDinhKyLuat \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..1\&quot; PhieuThuNopPhat\nQuyetDinhKyLuat \&quot;0..*\&quot; -- \&quot;0..1\&quot; ChiTietBangLuong\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="QqKilmnoBukfnB9RxZAH-1">
